---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="For Louisiana Students | Credits That Count"
  description="For Louisiana students: check courses you took, or courses you are thinking about taking, against Louisiana's published transfer rules, see what to take next, and follow verified transfer pathways."
>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="block" style="margin-top:26px;">
      <h1>For students</h1>
      <p>
        Whether you already finished a course or you are deciding what to
        sign up for next, the checker reads Louisiana's published transfer
        rules and shows you, course by course, what counts at the college
        you choose. Pick where to start:
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="pathgrid">
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#check-credits">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Match College Credits</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">See which of your courses count at the Louisiana college you choose, including dual enrollment courses.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#what-to-take-next">
          <span class="pathbox-title">What to Take Next</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">Find the courses that keep you on track.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#pathways">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Transfer Pathways</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">Sixteen pathways are verified in full today.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#eligibility">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Dual Enrollment</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">See if you meet the minimums to start dual enrollment, and check dual enrollment courses before you take them.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#degree-planner">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Degree Planner</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">Lay out your semesters at the college you choose.</span>
        </a>
        <a class="pathbox" href="/checker/#admission">
          <span class="pathbox-title">Admission Check</span>
          <span class="pathbox-desc">Check the admission standards for your college.</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <p>
        Every answer names its published source, so you can verify it with
        the college. Only the receiving college makes the final decision on
        how a credit applies.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="btn" href="/checker/">Open the Checker</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
